# Every combination of token kinds in positions 1, 2, 3 for toDt.
# Kinds: 1 digit=5, 2 digit <= 12=06, 2 digit 13-28=16, 2 digit > 31=45, month word=Sep, 4 digit=2025
# Separators are stripped before parsing, so a space stands in for '/', '-', etc.
# Rules: leading 4 digit year is y-m-d; a month word is surrounded by day and year;
# all numeric otherwise is m-d-y. Two digit year-first and numeric d-m-y are unsupported.
# Out of range components give none rather than rolling over.

'5 5 5' toDt match just d: $"5 5 5 -> {@d isoDateFmt}", none: "5 5 5 -> none", end wl
'5 5 06' toDt match just d: $"5 5 06 -> {@d isoDateFmt}", none: "5 5 06 -> none", end wl
